Mensa MD: third-party material
==============================

Sprout icon
  File:     app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_sprout.xml
  Used for: the vegan tag chip
  Source:   Material Symbols, icon "psychiatry" (Outlined, weight 400, 24px), by Google
            https://fonts.google.com/icons
            https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
            (symbols/android/psychiatry/materialsymbolsoutlined/psychiatry_24px.xml)
  License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
            https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Changes:  the theme-attribute tint was removed and the fill color set to black so the
            app can tint it per theme. The path data is unchanged.

Heart icons
  Files:    app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_favorite.xml (outlined, not a favorite)
            app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_favorite_filled.xml (filled, a favorite)
  Used for: the favorite toggle on dish cards
  Source:   Material Symbols, icon "favorite" (Outlined, weight 400, 24px, fill 0 and fill 1), by Google
            https://fonts.google.com/icons
            https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
            (symbols/android/favorite/materialsymbolsoutlined/favorite_24px.xml and favorite_fill1_24px.xml)
  License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
            https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Changes:  the theme-attribute tint was removed and the fill color set to black so the
            app can tint it per theme. The path data is unchanged.

Only these icons are included; the app has no dependency on any icon library.


